[Options]
[ai5PriestCaptured]
<h2>You receive a message from your ally:</h2>
<p>Ally, I desparately need your help.  I have no money and I have been captured.  Save me!

[ai5PriestDead]
<h2>You receive a message from the Furies</h2>
<p>Don't worry about your friend, for you will soon join him.

[ai2PriestDead]
$Menu=~[IwindWalker.1]Wind,GetTechnology,137

[ai3PriestDead]
$Menu=~[IwindBlocker.1]Wind,GetTechnology,142

[A.]
<h2>Low Priests Rise to the Call</h2>
<i>I will crush you like a grape.<br>
--The Low Priest of Thunder</i>  
<p>

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

<h2>You receive a message from the Low Priest of Thunder</h2>
<p>
You seem to be a great foe such as myself.  Will you ally with me so we can crush these puny priests?

$Button=YES,Tell,AllianceBegun
$Button=NO,Tell,NoAlliance
$Timeout=8,Tell,AllianceWithdrawn

[AllianceBegun]
<$Config,pickally1=1>
<$MissionBegin,Low2>

[AllianceWithdrawn]
<$Config,pickally1=0>
<p>
You waited too long to decide.  The Low Priest of Thunder thinks you are poking fun at him.  He withdraws his offer of alliance and warns he will crush you.
$Button=To Battle,DoNothing,0

[NoAlliance]
<$Config,pickally1=0>
<p>
You reject the Low Priest of Thunders' offer.  Fight on but beware!
$Button=To Battle,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>Success!</h2>
<p>
You fought well brave priest.

<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,Tourney

[Failed]
<h2>You have failed!</h2>
<p>
The Furies are feeling lenient towards you because of their lopsided victory.  You are given a second chance.

$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,Guard

[END]
